WEBVTT

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:21.500
So, in other words,

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.400
the fact that these large-scale tombs
were built in various places means that...

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:30.633
Just be patient a little while longer.

00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:32.700
I-I'm sorry!

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.033
Now, where was I?

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:37.367
Oh, I think...

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:42.367
Being able to swim all year long
does have its pros and cons.

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:44.367
My hair's getting totally fried.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:45.100
No kidding.

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:48.333
And the boys drool all over us.

00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:50.900
--Look at her!
--Wow!

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:54.067
Wow, check out Natsuki's figure.

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:55.833
She's like a model!

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:21.633
What was that?

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:31.433
"Girls' Changing Room"

00:01:31.433 --> 00:01:32.733
Hey!

00:01:32.733 --> 00:01:34.533
My bra is gone!

00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:35.367
What?!

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.533
No way! Mine's gone too!

00:01:37.533 --> 00:01:39.567
Oh, no! Oh, no!

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:42.833
I come to class for the first time
in ages, and this is what happens.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.667
This is stupid.

00:01:54.933 --> 00:02:00.500
"My-HiME"

00:02:01.533 --> 00:02:04.667
<i>All across the blue sky</i>

00:02:04.667 --> 00:02:08.100
<i>our feelings</i>

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.833
<i>are being mounted like gems</i>

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:16.400
<i>If only you were</i>

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:19.700
<i>my soul mate</i>

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:26.067
<i>but reality doesn't work that way</i>

00:02:26.067 --> 00:02:31.500
<i>In the sparkling wind</i>

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:38.833
<i>the wings of dreams descend</i>

00:02:38.833 --> 00:02:42.600
<i>Gather the courage to go into the future</i>

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:47.400
<i>with beauty</i>

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:54.767
<i>The hot heartbeats begin to pulse</i>

00:02:54.767 --> 00:02:58.000
<i>at the same speed</i>

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:01.867
<i>I felt that day</i>

00:03:01.867 --> 00:03:07.967
<i>I like direct gazes</i>

00:03:07.967 --> 00:03:15.700
<i>I want to stare forever</i>

00:03:16.733 --> 00:03:18.467
A panty thief?

00:03:18.467 --> 00:03:20.400
"Mischief of the Wind"
Yeah. Class B next door

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.900
"Mischief of the Wind"
got cleaned out during swimming class.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.900
I heard that a lot of girls in the
dorm have lost their bras as well.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.767
You guys aren't missing anything, right?

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:33.667
What's a bra?
Sounds like something to eat!

00:03:33.667 --> 00:03:36.533
Put your hands up, Mikoto.

00:03:39.633 --> 00:03:41.400
No bra.

00:03:41.933 --> 00:03:46.600
Hey, at least warn your roommate
not to walk around bra-less!

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:48.867
But Mikoto can't be
much more than a double A...

00:03:48.867 --> 00:03:50.667
That's not the point!

00:03:50.667 --> 00:03:54.400
There are lots of creeps out there
who are after underage girls, you know!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.867
You understand?

00:04:03.467 --> 00:04:05.633
Oh, that girl.

00:04:05.633 --> 00:04:07.033
Get real.

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:10.533
--Is that what she said?
--Too funny.

00:04:16.433 --> 00:04:19.000
Hey, Kuga. Is yours gone, too?

00:04:20.967 --> 00:04:23.667
What?

00:04:23.667 --> 00:04:26.500
You always wear such
expensive-looking lingerie.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.800
Well, they're not missing.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.933
I wouldn't let something
so stupid happen to me.

00:04:31.933 --> 00:04:35.500
Of course.
You always have it so together.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.000
It couldn't happen to you.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.667
Yeah...

00:04:40.067 --> 00:04:43.500
I just have to get to
the Student Council room.

00:04:45.967 --> 00:04:47.767
Hey, Reito.

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:50.967
How about giving
Yuichi Tate back to my club?

00:04:50.967 --> 00:04:53.433
I'm not the one you should be asking.

00:04:53.433 --> 00:04:55.633
Talk to Shizuru about it.

00:04:55.633 --> 00:04:58.100
Fujino's almost impossible to talk to.

00:05:00.067 --> 00:05:01.767
What's up?

00:05:06.367 --> 00:05:08.700
I see...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:11.033
I just remembered
something important I've got to do.

00:05:11.033 --> 00:05:12.900
You go on ahead!

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:13.700
Hey!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.433
Good luck.

00:05:17.767 --> 00:05:19.600
"Your wishes will not come true!
Those who defile the beauty"

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.433
"of this school cannot be forgiven.
No Wish Ribbons! - Executive Committee -"

00:05:23.733 --> 00:05:25.600
K-Kuga!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.600
T-Takeda!

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:31.700
How's it going, Kuga?

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:34.400
Wh-What do you want?

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.867
Uh, good to see you're
suited up and here for class.

00:05:36.867 --> 00:05:37.533
What?!

00:05:37.533 --> 00:05:40.067
I mean, you're well-suited
to the classes that are here!

00:05:40.067 --> 00:05:44.633
What?! You called me over
just to tell me that?!

00:05:44.633 --> 00:05:45.767
Step aside!

00:05:45.767 --> 00:05:47.600
Wh-What're you all mad about?

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.667
I told you to get out of the way!

00:05:49.667 --> 00:05:51.833
I have to go to my part-time job tonight.

00:05:51.833 --> 00:05:53.600
Can you mind the place by yourself?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:55.500
What does that mean, "mind the place"?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.667
I can't believe it...

00:05:58.767 --> 00:05:59.933
Huh?

00:06:02.867 --> 00:06:05.333
Um...

00:06:05.333 --> 00:06:08.000
Huh? W-Wait a minute...!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.700
Hang on!

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.033
That's enough!

00:06:51.033 --> 00:06:53.667
But, come on!

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:55.600
I can't take this!
I'm going to die laughing!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.633
Shut up!

00:06:56.633 --> 00:06:59.033
Wash them before
you give them back.

00:06:59.033 --> 00:07:00.700
I'll get you a new pair.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.367
Either way, you owe me for this.

00:07:03.367 --> 00:07:04.667
Yeah, yeah...

00:07:04.667 --> 00:07:07.567
Okay. How about you...

00:07:07.567 --> 00:07:09.800
...pay me back right now?

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.900
What?

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:13.667
Tell me something.

00:07:13.667 --> 00:07:15.533
What is a HiME?

00:07:15.533 --> 00:07:18.633
And what's going on at this school?

00:07:18.633 --> 00:07:21.433
I'm sure you met
the school headmaster.

00:07:21.433 --> 00:07:22.867
What did she tell you?

00:07:22.867 --> 00:07:24.400
I'm the one asking questions.

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.900
Just answer me!

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.733
She asked me to fight those
monsters known as the Orphans.

00:07:30.733 --> 00:07:33.067
And she told me that's
why we were called here.

00:07:33.067 --> 00:07:36.800
We're not the only ones
who've been brought here.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.700
I haven't figured out who they are,

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:42.833
but there are other HiME at this school.

00:07:42.833 --> 00:07:47.500
And there are people in the background
gathering HiME for some purpose.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.700
Probably for some other reason
than fighting the Orphans.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.733
--For some other purpose?
--Yes.

00:07:52.733 --> 00:07:57.933
I was trying to prevent more
HiME from coming to this school.

00:07:57.933 --> 00:07:59.733
That makes sense.

00:07:59.733 --> 00:08:03.667
So, are you still hoping to get rid of us?

00:08:05.033 --> 00:08:07.900
It's too late for that now.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.833
I'll have to keep my eyes open
and see what happens next.

00:08:10.833 --> 00:08:14.633
Then you're not going to be
coming after us or anything.

00:08:14.633 --> 00:08:16.833
Am I right?

00:08:16.833 --> 00:08:19.367
As long as you don't get in my way.

00:08:19.367 --> 00:08:20.567
Okay!

00:08:20.567 --> 00:08:22.400
Right, Mikoto?

00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:25.900
You can't be picking any more fights, okay?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:26.800
But...

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:29.567
I'll stop making yummy lunches for you!

00:08:32.467 --> 00:08:34.000
Okay, I won't!

00:08:35.533 --> 00:08:37.333
This is a challenge!

00:08:37.333 --> 00:08:40.000
--You think?
--Of course!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:43.033
While that complacent Shizuru
Fujino continues to run this place,

00:08:43.033 --> 00:08:45.800
morals are plummeting
and rules are being broken!

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:46.900
Look at this!

00:08:46.900 --> 00:08:50.600
It's as though they're scorting
the Executive Committee!

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:51.767
Don't you mean "scorning"?

00:08:51.767 --> 00:08:53.333
Shut up!

00:08:53.333 --> 00:08:54.600
Yukino!

00:08:54.600 --> 00:08:56.600
I'm calling an emergency
Executive Committee assembly!

00:08:56.600 --> 00:09:00.600
We'll catch this panty thief and
drag him before the Student Council!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.633
And I'll show them.

00:09:02.633 --> 00:09:08.700
I'll expose the ineptitude of
that <i>bubuzuke </i>girl and her tea boy!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.533
Hey, what does "<i>bubuzuke</i>" mean?

00:09:10.533 --> 00:09:13.333
It's a take on "<i>chazuke</i>" or tea-rice gruel.

00:09:13.333 --> 00:09:16.033
--That's perfect for Fujino!
--You didn't know what it meant?

00:09:17.633 --> 00:09:20.567
It's too bad this happened to you.

00:09:20.567 --> 00:09:22.467
Does this kind of stuff
occur often at the school?

00:09:22.467 --> 00:09:24.100
Don't be ridiculous!

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:27.333
It's the first time we've
had a panty thief around here.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:31.967
Hey, Mikoto!

00:09:31.967 --> 00:09:33.600
What're you doing?!

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.033
Is that a bra?

00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:37.100
Yeah, why?

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.033
And that's what everyone's missing?

00:09:39.033 --> 00:09:39.833
Yeah.

00:09:39.833 --> 00:09:41.033
And panties.

00:09:41.033 --> 00:09:42.100
Shut up!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.700
Oh.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:45.800
Well...

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:47.833
What?!

00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:50.733
Come on, Mikoto. You can't be serious!

00:09:50.733 --> 00:09:52.433
It wasn't threatening.

00:09:52.433 --> 00:09:54.733
That's why I'd forgotten.

00:09:54.733 --> 00:09:56.367
Of all the things to forget...!

00:09:56.367 --> 00:09:58.400
An Orphan...

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:01.800
That's what it was.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.000
I'll make it pay for what it did!

00:10:07.367 --> 00:10:09.400
"Spiritual State of Nothingness"

00:10:15.467 --> 00:10:17.933
All right! I'm over it...!

00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:20.067
Oh, no!

00:10:20.067 --> 00:10:21.567
Are you all right?

00:10:21.567 --> 00:10:23.000
I messed up.

00:10:27.767 --> 00:10:30.000
Your teriyaki chicken order's up.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.433
Coming!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.667
Akane...

00:10:34.667 --> 00:10:35.833
Um...

00:10:35.833 --> 00:10:37.767
Want me to walk you home?

00:10:37.767 --> 00:10:40.500
There's a panty thief
on the loose and all.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:42.033
Kazu...

00:10:44.733 --> 00:10:48.833
Ow, ow, ow...

00:10:48.833 --> 00:10:51.067
Uh, I'm so sorry...

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:53.833
We're very sorry to disturb you.

00:10:53.833 --> 00:10:56.733
Mai...

00:10:56.733 --> 00:10:58.000
Come on.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.433
How may plates have you broken,
even in the time I've been here?

00:11:01.433 --> 00:11:02.700
Because...

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:06.867
Unlike you, I'm new
to doing this kind of work.

00:11:06.867 --> 00:11:08.367
Right...

00:11:08.367 --> 00:11:10.467
Welcome!

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:14.000
Yuichi, what do you feel like eating?

00:11:19.533 --> 00:11:21.867
Team 4 is in position and ready.

00:11:21.867 --> 00:11:23.933
Team 5, in position!

00:11:26.733 --> 00:11:29.033
Team 6, in position!

00:11:29.033 --> 00:11:31.467
Everyone's in position, Haruka.

00:11:31.467 --> 00:11:33.467
Excellent.

00:11:33.467 --> 00:11:35.433
Attention all members.

00:11:35.433 --> 00:11:37.800
The honor of the
Executive Committee is at stake.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.400
Apprehend the panty thief!

00:11:43.467 --> 00:11:46.333
I need a lot more training.

00:12:13.633 --> 00:12:16.367
Wh-What was that?

00:12:16.367 --> 00:12:17.767
Stop right there!

00:12:20.633 --> 00:12:22.400
We have identified the culprit!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.333
He's appears to be in possession
of stolen underwear!

00:12:25.333 --> 00:12:26.600
Orders, please!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.767
Uh, hey...

00:12:27.767 --> 00:12:29.500
I didn't do anything!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.400
--Apprehend him!
--Apprehend him!

00:12:34.533 --> 00:12:35.667
They got him.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:38.500
"Tokiha"

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:40.967
Your order?

00:12:40.967 --> 00:12:42.067
How about a smile?

00:12:42.067 --> 00:12:43.933
We don't offer that.

00:12:43.933 --> 00:12:45.967
What an attitude.

00:12:45.967 --> 00:12:48.667
I treat customers the
way they treat others.

00:12:48.667 --> 00:12:50.533
I know! I want an octopus rice meal.

00:12:50.533 --> 00:12:52.867
Okay! Octopus meal!

00:12:52.867 --> 00:12:55.567
So you work here part-time, Mai?

00:12:55.567 --> 00:12:56.800
That's right.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:59.500
Um, Shiho, was it?

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.533
I work here as a kind of hobby!

00:13:01.533 --> 00:13:02.400
Hobby?

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:02.933
Yeah.

00:13:02.933 --> 00:13:04.767
My hobby is to try
all kinds of different jobs.

00:13:04.767 --> 00:13:05.667
Wow.

00:13:05.667 --> 00:13:09.033
So, what kind of jobs
have you had up until now?

00:13:09.033 --> 00:13:11.467
Well, many kinds. I've had about
30 different kinds of jobs so far.

00:13:11.467 --> 00:13:13.867
Unreal!

00:13:13.867 --> 00:13:15.433
Sir!

00:13:15.433 --> 00:13:17.067
In consideration of other customers...

00:13:17.067 --> 00:13:18.833
Hello? Tate here.

00:13:18.833 --> 00:13:20.600
Yes. It's fine.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:21.633
What a jerk.

00:13:21.633 --> 00:13:22.700
Yes?

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:25.067
What? They caught him?!

00:13:25.067 --> 00:13:25.967
It's Takeda?!

00:13:25.967 --> 00:13:26.833
"Student Council Room"
It's Takeda?!

00:13:26.833 --> 00:13:27.633
"Student Council Room"

00:13:28.100 --> 00:13:29.900
He's been framed.

00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:32.933
That's what we believe too, but still...

00:13:32.933 --> 00:13:34.700
How can you be so sure?

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:37.833
It's just Suzushiro and
the others getting carried away.

00:13:37.833 --> 00:13:38.900
I was just asking.

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:40.500
What?

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.500
Well, you know he's... right?

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.833
You're totally wrong!

00:13:44.833 --> 00:13:47.933
I can't help it if the guy likes to talk to me.

00:13:47.933 --> 00:13:52.867
Well, I'm not trying to cover for
him because he's my classmate,

00:13:52.867 --> 00:13:56.733
but I don't think that Takeda is
the kind of guy who would do that.

00:13:56.733 --> 00:14:00.000
And he doesn't seem like the type
who'd get off on a pair of girls' panties.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.767
There's got to be something in them.

00:14:05.633 --> 00:14:08.600
So? Where is Takeda, anyway?

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:12.000
He wouldn't cooperate with
the committee's investigation.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.333
So he was sent to the chapel.

00:14:15.067 --> 00:14:16.633
The chapel, huh?

00:14:16.633 --> 00:14:18.600
What a terrible mess.

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:19.767
Youth...

00:14:19.767 --> 00:14:22.433
The most beautiful time of your life.

00:14:22.433 --> 00:14:26.967
But youth can lead you to stray
from the path of righteousness.

00:14:26.967 --> 00:14:30.800
It is because you can be misguided that
the Lord finds it in your heart to love you.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.767
The Lord will surely forgive you.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:35.733
Yes.

00:14:35.733 --> 00:14:37.467
The blessings of the Lord...

00:14:37.467 --> 00:14:40.500
...are always there for you,
radiant from above!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.600
Um...

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.367
Yes, Mr. Takeda.

00:14:43.367 --> 00:14:46.633
I honestly didn't do it!
Please believe me!

00:14:46.633 --> 00:14:48.533
I understand.

00:14:48.533 --> 00:14:51.767
It wasn't actually you
who committed the crime.

00:14:51.767 --> 00:14:52.433
Then...

00:14:52.433 --> 00:14:56.033
The guilty one is the devil
that lurks in the shadows.

00:14:56.033 --> 00:14:57.433
Indeed.

00:14:57.433 --> 00:14:59.933
The devil known as the passions of youth!

00:14:59.933 --> 00:15:03.367
Now, have courage
and let us pray together.

00:15:03.367 --> 00:15:04.500
After that...

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.067
We can have a refreshing dialogue
with our purified spirits!

00:15:09.033 --> 00:15:10.867
Get me out of here.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:15.367
It's all going well, I suppose.

00:15:15.367 --> 00:15:16.867
Mai has awakened.

00:15:16.867 --> 00:15:18.833
And the remaining HiME are...

00:15:18.833 --> 00:15:20.867
Let's see...

00:15:20.867 --> 00:15:22.433
Well, well...

00:15:22.433 --> 00:15:23.667
I've been looking for you.

00:15:23.667 --> 00:15:27.933
How lucky I am to be
sought out by Natsuki.

00:15:27.933 --> 00:15:30.400
Have you missed me that much?

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:33.533
Spit it out! Tell me where the Orphan is!

00:15:33.533 --> 00:15:35.333
Thanks to him, I was...

00:15:35.333 --> 00:15:38.400
Catch a draft on your cute little bum?

00:15:42.367 --> 00:15:44.500
Uh, I was just joking!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.400
I don't know what I was saying!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:49.067
I really can't answer your question!

00:15:49.067 --> 00:15:51.067
How can I draw him out?

00:15:51.067 --> 00:15:53.900
How can I get him to come out?

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.433
Do I want to tell you?

00:15:55.433 --> 00:15:57.967
All right, I get your point.

00:15:57.967 --> 00:15:59.000
Listen...

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:02.467
Orphans and Childs
are basically the same.

00:16:02.467 --> 00:16:05.567
They both tend to be drawn to HiME.

00:16:05.567 --> 00:16:07.367
Which means that...

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:11.533
Wha...?! Wha...?! Wha...?!

00:16:11.533 --> 00:16:12.767
What?!

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.733
What is this?

00:16:15.733 --> 00:16:17.800
Quite a sight.

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:20.033
Student Council President...

00:16:20.033 --> 00:16:21.900
Your name is Mai, right?

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:23.933
Are you just getting home now?

00:16:23.933 --> 00:16:25.533
Yeah.

00:16:25.533 --> 00:16:27.467
I was wondering...

00:16:27.467 --> 00:16:29.667
I don't see the point of this!

00:16:29.667 --> 00:16:32.067
Does this mean you doubt
the work we've done?!

00:16:32.067 --> 00:16:33.633
Haruka...

00:16:33.633 --> 00:16:36.067
That's not the case at all.

00:16:36.067 --> 00:16:39.533
In fact, I feel badly that
we're always assigning

00:16:39.533 --> 00:16:42.467
such difficult jobs to
the Executive Committee.

00:16:42.467 --> 00:16:45.033
I really feel badly about it.

00:16:45.033 --> 00:16:49.400
So I thought that perhaps
we could help out.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.500
These are all borrowed,

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:54.867
so if something were to happen,
it'd be no loss to the dorm residents.

00:16:54.867 --> 00:16:56.533
You can rest assured.

00:16:56.533 --> 00:16:59.433
I-I wasn't really meaning to...

00:16:59.433 --> 00:17:01.967
A camisole, petticoat...

00:17:01.967 --> 00:17:05.567
...girdle, garters, shaped panties...

00:17:05.567 --> 00:17:06.600
Bras and panties...

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:08.533
And a bodysuit, even.

00:17:08.533 --> 00:17:11.100
Where did you get these from?!

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:14.100
They're from an interested party.

00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:16.333
Miss Suzushiro...

00:17:16.333 --> 00:17:18.000
What is it?

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:20.467
We're counting on you.

00:17:21.733 --> 00:17:24.100
Of course you can count on us!

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.833
Let's go, Yukino!

00:17:27.767 --> 00:17:28.767
Okay.

00:17:28.767 --> 00:17:29.633
So?

00:17:29.633 --> 00:17:31.800
What are we doing here, anyway?

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:34.100
I came up with this plan.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.400
Got a problem with that?

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:36.867
That's not really the point...

00:17:36.867 --> 00:17:38.833
This is smaller than yours, Mai.

00:17:38.833 --> 00:17:41.467
Where did you get that push-up bra?

00:17:41.467 --> 00:17:42.767
There're hanging out there.

00:17:42.767 --> 00:17:44.467
Don't stretch it!

00:17:45.667 --> 00:17:48.900
She said she borrowed
these from an interested party...

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.100
What?! Do all of these belong to you?!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.500
Shut up!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.967
And why do you have so many?

00:17:53.967 --> 00:17:56.567
I'll tell you the reason, but...

00:17:56.567 --> 00:17:58.567
...you're going to have
to cooperate with me.

00:17:58.567 --> 00:18:01.767
--I'll pass on any fighting.
--I'm not counting on you for that anyway.

00:18:04.400 --> 00:18:05.967
What are you doing?!

00:18:05.967 --> 00:18:08.333
But Haruka, there was a bug.

00:18:08.333 --> 00:18:11.467
Where is that big-talking Student
Council President, anyway?

00:18:11.467 --> 00:18:13.700
I'm sure she's in her room.

00:18:15.067 --> 00:18:16.633
You're so mean...

00:18:17.567 --> 00:18:20.800
How could I have fallen for
another one of Fujino's tricks?!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.467
Take it easy, Haruka.

00:18:22.467 --> 00:18:23.800
Think of it as camping out...?

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:24.600
Okay?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:27.100
How many times has this happened?

00:18:29.033 --> 00:18:31.400
But that's my favorite.

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.367
You did say you'd cooperate.

00:18:33.367 --> 00:18:35.633
Orphan bait, huh?

00:18:46.967 --> 00:18:48.567
Gimme a break.

00:19:08.733 --> 00:19:10.467
Wha...?!

00:19:11.567 --> 00:19:13.867
Haruka! Say something! Haruka!

00:19:13.867 --> 00:19:16.700
We've spotted the panty thief! Go after him!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:23.033
Wh-What happened?

00:19:25.533 --> 00:19:28.867
What?! He took all the underwear...

00:19:28.867 --> 00:19:32.033
He won't get away!

00:19:32.033 --> 00:19:32.833
Duran!

00:19:32.833 --> 00:19:34.933
What?!

00:19:39.833 --> 00:19:42.567
You idiot!

00:19:42.567 --> 00:19:44.833
Fine! I'll do it just to get my own bra back!

00:19:44.833 --> 00:19:46.767
Haruka!

00:19:46.767 --> 00:19:49.400
Huh? What on earth happened?

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.867
Huh? Huh?

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.367
What?!

00:19:54.367 --> 00:19:57.333
There was nothing left
by the time I looked.

00:19:57.333 --> 00:19:59.033
What a shock.

00:19:59.033 --> 00:20:02.867
I wonder if Takeda escaped
from the chapel or something.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:12.333
This is it!

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.667
No way!

00:20:25.667 --> 00:20:27.867
I don't care
how many of you there are.

00:20:43.933 --> 00:20:45.767
Duran!

00:20:49.467 --> 00:20:51.467
So, this is your true form.

00:20:52.733 --> 00:20:53.933
Duran!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:18.967
Now! Mikoto!

00:21:24.567 --> 00:21:26.400
Nice one, Mikoto!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:30.567
That's all the help you're going to get!

00:21:30.567 --> 00:21:32.533
You guys...

00:21:32.533 --> 00:21:33.433
Duran!

00:21:33.433 --> 00:21:35.033
Load Silver Cartridge!

00:21:36.967 --> 00:21:38.533
Fire!

00:21:59.767 --> 00:22:01.367
Wh-What is this?

00:22:01.367 --> 00:22:03.400
Hey, I can't see anything.

00:22:04.433 --> 00:22:06.433
Look what happened to my bra!

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:11.500
My...

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:13.400
...whole collection...

00:22:14.367 --> 00:22:16.000
This is the worst.

00:22:20.733 --> 00:22:24.000
You idiot!

00:22:26.367 --> 00:22:31.900
<i>I couldn't tell you not to lose your way</i>

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:37.667
<i>There are thoughts that'll never reach you</i>

00:22:37.667 --> 00:22:42.867
<i>A smile that is too Ionely quivers</i>

00:22:42.867 --> 00:22:48.067
<i>I puzzle over my wounds LONELY GOOD-BYE</i>

00:22:48.067 --> 00:22:54.767
<i>Even my passion hurts</i>

00:22:54.767 --> 00:22:59.800
<i>as I chase after an eternal fragment</i>

00:22:59.800 --> 00:23:06.600
<i>You were the sky, you were the dream</i>

00:23:06.600 --> 00:23:10.467
<i>The days that burn and melt</i>

00:23:12.033 --> 00:23:18.067
<i>Make them unforgettable memories</i>

00:23:18.067 --> 00:23:23.533
<i>Wear them proudly on your chest</i>

00:23:23.533 --> 00:23:25.433
<i>SEARCH FOR MY LIFE</i>

00:23:25.433 --> 00:23:29.700
<i>We will be able to meet again</i>

00:23:29.700 --> 00:23:34.833
<i>I loved those transparent eyes</i>

00:23:34.833 --> 00:23:39.900
<i>Now we have our own paths</i>

00:23:39.900 --> 00:23:43.067
<i>carrying on RESTARTING</i>

00:23:56.333 --> 00:23:56.933
"Rain -- Tears…"

00:23:56.933 --> 00:23:58.500
"Rain -- Tears…"
This is the proper way to put on a bra.

00:23:58.500 --> 00:23:59.800
"Rain -- Tears…"
First you place it over on top.

00:23:59.800 --> 00:24:01.667
"Rain -- Tears…"
After the cups are in place,

00:24:01.667 --> 00:24:02.900
"Rain -- Tears…"
you pull the breasts up and together,

00:24:02.900 --> 00:24:04.033
"Rain -- Tears…"
up and together,

00:24:04.033 --> 00:24:05.600
"Rain -- Tears…"
and squeeze them in there!

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:07.567
"Rain -- Tears…"
Isn't that better?

00:24:07.567 --> 00:24:11.456
"Rain -- Tears…"
I guess this is pointless.
